          "short": "$-\\frac{8}{9}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-2x&=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^2-2\\times\\frac{2}{3}\\\\x^2-2x&=\\frac{4}{9}-\\frac{4}{3}\\\\x^2-2x&=\\frac{4}{9}-\\frac{12}{9}\\\\x^2-2x&=-\\frac{8}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
