          "short": "$\\frac{16}{9}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-2x&=\\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^2-2\\times\\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\\\x^2-2x&=\\frac{4}{9}+\\frac{4}{3}\\\\x^2-2x&=\\frac{4}{9}+\\frac{12}{9}\\\\x^2-2x&=\\frac{16}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
